      "label": "P: “As a game and app prototyping studio, we build high-quality…”",
      "group": "We help studios, startups, and investor…",
      "value": "As a game and app prototyping studio, we build high-quality playable prototypes that help teams validate ideas before full development.<br data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"834\">Our rapid prototyping approach turns concepts into real, testable products in weeks, allowing teams to make better decisions early."
