    {
      "id": "e47",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “Prototype-First Thinking”",
      "group": "Prototype-First Thinking",
      "value": "Prototype-First Thinking"
    },
    {
      "id": "e48",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “Most game and mobile app ideas start as assumptions. As a g…”",
      "group": "Prototype-First Thinking",
      "value": "Most game and mobile app ideas start as assumptions. As a game development studio, we begin with game prototyping to turn those assumptions into evidence. Every prototype is built to answer real questions early, helping teams move forward with confidence instead of guesswork."
    },
    {
      "id": "e49",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “Structured Experimentation, Not Random Testing”",
      "group": "Structured Experimentation, Not Random …",
      "value": "Structured Experimentation, Not Random Testing"
    },
    {
      "id": "e50",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “We treat prototyping as a focused experiment, not a creativ…”",
      "group": "Structured Experimentation, Not Random …",
      "value": "We treat prototyping as a focused experiment, not a creative gamble. Each build starts with a clear hypothesis, defined goals, and measurable outcomes. By keeping the process structured, we help clients understand what works before scaling into full development."
    },
    {
      "id": "e51",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “Clear Scope and Fast Decisions”",
      "group": "Clear Scope and Fast Decisions",
      "value": "Clear Scope and Fast Decisions"
    },
    {
      "id": "e52",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “Strict timelines and clear constraints keep projects moving…”",
      "group": "Clear Scope and Fast Decisions",
      "value": "Strict timelines and clear constraints keep projects moving efficiently. At every milestone, teams get clarity on the next step, whether that means improving the concept, changing direction, or doubling down on what’s working. This approach saves both time and budget in the long run."
    },
    {
      "id": "e53",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “From Prototype to Full-Cycle Development”",
      "group": "From Prototype to Full-Cycle Development",
      "value": "From Prototype to Full-Cycle Development"
    },
    {
      "id": "e54",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: “A strong prototype builds trust quickly. Once the direction…”",
      "group": "From Prototype to Full-Cycle Development",
      "value": "A strong prototype builds trust quickly. Once the direction is validated, we transition into full-cycle development, covering production planning, engineering, game art, and long-term support. Clients don’t need to start over, they continue with the same team and shared understanding of the product."
    },
    {
      "id": "e55",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “Sophie Bennett”",
      "group": "Sophie Bennett",
      "value": "Sophie Bennett"
    },
    {
      "id": "e56",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: ““They don’t just execute tasks, they actually think with yo…”",
      "group": "Sophie Bennett",
      "value": "“They don’t just execute tasks, they actually think with you. From idea to prototype, everything felt collaborative and well thought-out. It’s rare to find a game prototyping studio this reliable and easy to work with.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "e57",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “Daniel Carter”",
      "group": "Daniel Carter",
      "value": "Daniel Carter"
    },
    {
      "id": "e58",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: ““What stood out the most was their speed and structure. The…”",
      "group": "Daniel Carter",
      "value": "“What stood out the most was their speed and structure. They move fast, but never at the expense of quality. You always know where things stand, which makes the whole process stress-free.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "e59",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "H2: “Alex Morgan”",
      "group": "Alex Morgan",
      "value": "Alex Morgan"
    },
    {
      "id": "e60",
      "kind": "text",
      "label": "P: ““Working with this team was a genuinely smooth experience. …”",
      "group": "Alex Morgan",
      "value": "“Working with this team was a genuinely smooth experience. Communication was clear, deadlines were respected, and the final result exceeded expectations. It felt like working with people who really care about what they build.”"
    },
